{"asset_key":"ep8/herohub_story_18411110","episode":"ep8","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"18411110","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1841111001:0":{"text":"And now we're going up against Bantus again—on their own ground, no less.","source_cn":"又要与班题斯交手了，而且还是在班题斯的领土上。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4FE71500BA8675D9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1841111002:0":{"text":"We'll need to prepare for everything. Weapons, traps, potions—we can't afford to leave anything out.","source_cn":"我们需要多做准备。武器、陷阱、药剂，都必不可少。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x33E686DF21C99C26","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1841111003:0":{"text":"And we need a strategy. Defense comes first. We may never get an opening to clear the area, and we'll need a fallback plan too... preferably before we go in.","source_cn":"还有策略。主要是防守的策略，清剿策略可能没有实施空间，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAA312DE36A354205","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1841111004:0":{"text":"... If only Baden had his memories back.","source_cn":"……如果巴登没有失忆就好了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8F026E3117D73718","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1841111005:0":{"text":"...\nDon't worry. He'll remember eventually.","source_cn":"………………\\n别太担心，他总会恢复的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3E483C1B2651531F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:瑟恩":{"text":"Thane","source":"瑟恩","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:爱丝特瑞达":{"text":"Estrilda","source":"爱丝特瑞达","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":6,"localized_text_count":5,"speaker_count":2}}